 border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-5 sm:p-6"><p class="m-0 font-mono text-[clamp(26px,3vw,34px)] leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#171717]"><span class="tabular-nums">0+</span></p><p class="m-0 text-[13px] font-medium leading-snug text-[#3f3f46]">Live data sources</p><p class="m-0 text-[12px] leading-snug text-[#71717a]">Google Maps, social profiles, job boards, Shopify, and more</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-[20px] border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-5 sm:p-6"><p class="m-0 font-mono text-[clamp(26px,3vw,34px)] leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#171717]"><span class="tabular-nums">&lt; 0 min</span></p><p class="m-0 text-[13px] font-medium leading-snug text-[#3f3f46]">From prompt to spreadsheet</p><p class="m-0 text-[12px] leading-snug text-[#71717a]">results populate in real time</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-[20px] border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-5 sm:p-6"><p class="m-0 font-mono text-[clamp(26px,3vw,34px)] leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#171717]"><span class="tabular-nums">0K</span></p><p class="m-0 text-[13px] font-medium leading-snug text-[#3f3f46]">Leads per search</p><p class="m-0 text-[12px] leading-snug text-[#71717a]">fetch more with one click</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-[20px] border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-5 sm:p-6"><p class="m-0 font-mono text-[clamp(26px,3vw,34px)] leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#171717]"><span class="tabular-nums">0</span></p><p class="m-0 text-[13px] font-medium leading-snug text-[#3f3f46]">API keys needed</p><p class="m-0 text-[12px] leading-snug text-[#71717a]">every data source is built in</p></div></div></div></section></div><section class="border-t border-[#e4e4e7] px-5 py-[clamp(56px,9vw,104px)]"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1100px] flex-col gap-10"><div class="flex max-w-[760px] flex-col gap-3.5"><p class="m-0 text-[13px] text-[#71717a]">[02] What You Actually Get</p><h2 class="font-[family-name:var(--font-frank-ruhl-libre)] font-normal m-0 text-[clamp(32px,4vw,52px)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.025em] text-[#171717]">A spreadsheet of real leads.<br/><span class="text-[#71717a]">With real data from real sources.</span></h2><p class="m-0 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]">Not a magic black box. Origami searches specific data sources you can see, returns structured results in a table you can edit, and lets you add enrichment columns for emails, phone numbers, tech stack, and more.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-[#e4e4e7] md:grid-cols-2"><article class="flex flex-col bg-white p-6 sm:p-7"><h3 class="m-0 text-[19px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#09090b]">Chat interface → spreadsheet output</h3><p class="m-0 mt-2.5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]">You type what you&#x27;re looking for in plain English. The AI interprets your request, picks the right data sources, and populates a spreadsheet. You can see every source it searched and refine with follow-up messages.</p></article><article class="flex flex-col bg-white p-6 sm:p-7"><h3 class="m-0 text-[19px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#09090b]">15+ built-in data sources</h3><p class="m-0 mt-2.5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]">Social profiles and companies, Google Maps listings, job boards (100+ aggregated), Shopify and WooCommerce stores, tech stack databases, funding data, news, Twitter/X, and more. No API keys or external accounts needed.</p></article><article class="flex flex-col bg-white p-6 sm:p-7"><h3 class="m-0 text-[19px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#09090b]">Add enrichment columns</h3><p class="m-0 mt-2.5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]">Once your leads are in the spreadsheet, ask Origami to add columns, verified work emails, direct phone numbers, employee count, tech stack, funding history, or any custom data point. Each column enriches every row automatically.</p></article><article class="flex flex-col bg-white p-6 sm:p-7"><h3 class="m-0 text-[19px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#09090b]">Relevance scoring</h3><p class="m-0 mt-2.5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]">Define what makes a lead qualified and Origami scores every row as pass, fail, or unsure. Filter to show only qualified leads, then export. No manual sorting through hundreds of irrelevant results.</p></article><article class="flex flex-col bg-white p-6 sm:p-7"><h3 class="m-0 text-[19px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#09090b]">CSV import</h3><p class="m-0 mt-2.5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]">Already have a list? Upload a CSV and Origami matches your records against live data, fills in missing fields, and adds whatever enrichment columns you need. Same AI, applied to your existing data.</p></article><article class="flex flex-col bg-white p-6 sm:p-7"><h3 class="m-0 text-[19px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#09090b]">Enroll, export, or hand off</h3><p class="m-0 mt-2.5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]">Drop your filtered list into the built-in Sequencer for social and email outreach, push to HubSpot or Salesforce, or download a clean CSV. The list goes from search results to active outreach in the same surface.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-[#e4e4e7] px-5 py-[clamp(56px,9vw,104px)]"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1100px] flex-col gap-10"><div class="flex max-w-[760px] flex-col gap-3.5"><p class="m-0 text-[13px] text-[#71717a]">[03] What People Actually Search For</p><h2 class="font-[family-name:var(--font-frank-ruhl-libre)] font-normal m-0 text-[clamp(32px,4vw,52px)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.025em] text-[#171717]">Real prompts from real users.</h2></div><ul class="m-0 grid list-none divide-y divide-[#f4f4f5] overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-0"><li class="grid gap-4 p-6 sm:p-7 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.6fr)] md:gap-12"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[#71717a]">01</span><h3 class="m-0 text-[19px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#09090b]">Local service businesses</h3></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]">Google Maps is one of Origami&#x27;s strongest sources. Find any local business by type, location, rating, and review count, then enrich with owner contact info that traditional B2B databases don&#x27;t have.</p><p class="m-0 rounded-xl bg-[#fafafa] px-3.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]"><span class="text-[#71717a]">Example:</span> “<!-- -->Roofing companies in Dallas with 10+ employees and a 4.5+ Google rating<!-- -->”</p></div></li><li class="grid gap-4 p-6 sm:p-7 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.6fr)] md:gap-12"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[#71717a]">02</span><h3 class="m-0 text-[19px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#09090b]">Funded startups hiring specific roles</h3></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]">Combine funding data with live job board monitoring. Find companies that just raised capital and are actively hiring for roles that signal they need your product.</p><p class="m-0 rounded-xl bg-[#fafafa] px-3.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]"><span class="text-[#71717a]">Example:</span> “<!-- -->Series B SaaS companies in Austin hiring their first VP of Sales<!-- -->”</p></div></li><li class="grid gap-4 p-6 sm:p-7 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.6fr)] md:gap-12"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[#71717a]">03</span><h3 class="m-0 text-[19px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#09090b]">E-commerce brands on specific platforms</h3></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]">Search Shopify and WooCommerce store directories filtered by category, traffic, and tech stack. Find brands that match your ideal customer profile.</p><p class="m-0 rounded-xl bg-[#fafafa] px-3.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]"><span class="text-[#71717a]">Example:</span> “<!-- -->Shopify stores selling pet products with 50+ reviews doing estimated $1M+ revenue<!-- -->”</p></div></li><li class="grid gap-4 p-6 sm:p-7 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.6fr)] md:gap-12"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-[#71717a]">04</span><h3 class="m-0 text-[19px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#09090b]">People who posted about a specific topic</h3></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]">Search social posts and Twitter for people discussing specific challenges, tools, or topics. Find prospects based on what they&#x27;re actually talking about, not just their job title.</p><p class="m-0 rounded-xl bg-[#fafafa] px-3.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]"><span class="text-[#71717a]">Example:</span> “<!-- -->Marketing directors who posted about switching from HubSpot in the last 30 days<!-- -->”</p></div></li></ul></div></section><section class="w-full px-5 py-[clamp(56px,9vw,104px)]"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1240px] grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,400px),1fr))] items-center gap-8 rounded-[28px] border border-[#fcc6e3] bg-[#fef0f7] p-[clamp(32px,6vw,80px)]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><h2 class="font-[family-name:var(--font-frank-ruhl-libre)] font-normal m-0 text-[clamp(34px,4.4vw,60px)] leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#171717]">Find your next perfect customers.</h2><p class="m-0 max-w-[520px] text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[#52525b]">Join teams who are already using AI to build pipeline faster. Start your free trial today.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-3 max-[880px]:items-start"><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-end gap-3 max-[880px]:justify-start"><a href="/sign-u